"methodology for what to capture, what to skip, how to classify learnings,"
" and the entry templates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/capture.md:10
msgid ""
"If nothing meets the capture threshold, say so: \"No new knowledge to "
"capture from this session.\""
msgstr ""

